TinyCC 0.9.27 (i386 sources only) vendored for ICS-OS self-hosting.
Upstream: https://bellard.org/tcc/  License: LGPL-2.1

Host build (produces apps/tcc.exe):
  make -C contrib/tcc && make -C contrib/tcc install

In-OS self-build (requires a working apps/tcc.exe on the image):
  tccboot
  # stages sources to /ramdisk, compiles ONE_SOURCE tcc -> /ramdisk/tccnew.exe,
  # verifies -v and compiling min.c, installs to /icsos/apps/tcc.exe when possible

Automated test:
  make test-tccboot
